    "countRoll": "Friends, Enemies, and Tragic Love Affairs each use: roll 1d10 and subtract 7, minimum 0, to determine how many you have. Then roll once per instance.",
    "enemyNote": "Each enemy is built from four linked rolls: enemy_who, enemy_cause, enemy_throw, plus who was the injured party (a choice, not a roll). Then consult sweet_revenge for what happens when you meet."
