            "Tahitian Victoria's already decided to play a Netrunner. That means her next step is the Lifepath. She starts with Cultural Origins and decides to roll instead of choose. She likes the idea of stringing together a bunch of random results into a comprehensive Character background. Victoria rolls a 6 on a d10. According to the Cultural Origins table",
