        {
          "roll": 10,
          "value": "Strange contacts Victoria's now knows her Netrunner's Cultural Origins (Sub-Saharan Africa) and her Personality (stable and serious). Next is Dress and Personal Style. There's three categories: Clothing Style, Hairstyle, and Affectation. V i c t o r i a r o l l s 4 f o r C l o t h i n g S t y l e: Businesswear. She rolls 9 for Hairstyle: Short and curly. And she rolls 5 for Affectation: Nose rings. Obviously, Victoria like to keep things neat and professional. Thinking about it, she decides her Netrunner gets this from her family, who instilled a need to \"dress to impress\" in her from a young age, especially when dealing with outsiders. \"Outsiders rarely look below the surface,\" her father told her, \"Make sure your surface says you mean business\". Victoria's Netrunner prefers sharp suits and keeps her hair short but natural. The nose ring is a little touch of home, as it was a gift Victoria's Character received before she left Ethiopia. \u25b6"
        }
      ]
